{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.mkLatticeOpRule\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkLatticeOpRule</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rhs</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">op</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">Meta.Sym.SymM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Apply.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.BackwardRule\">Meta.Sym.BackwardRule</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Build a reusable backward rule decomposing `pre ⊑ op … s⃗` for a lattice operator. The operator's\nvalue arguments are made schematic; `rewrites` saturate the operator through its distribution and\nunfolding equalities, the terminal keyed by the reduced head fires, and any state arguments left\nover-applied by the terminal move onto the precondition through a frame for them. When the reduced head has no\nregistered terminal, the saturated `pre ⊑ reduced` is handed back as the sole subgoal. Throws when the\noperator neither reduces nor has a terminal, since its rule would be the identity; the operator's\n`applies?` filter keeps such shapes away from rule construction.\n\nFor `⊓`, produces `∀ a b s⃗ pre, pre ⊑ a s⃗ → pre ⊑ b s⃗ → pre ⊑ (a ⊓ b) s⃗`. For the opaque residual\n`upperAdjoint f b`, produces `∀ f b s⃗ pre, f (fun u⃗ => ⌜u⃗ = s⃗⌝ ⊓ pre) ⊑ b → pre ⊑ upperAdjoint f b s⃗`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.mkLatticeOpRule","kind":"def","line":186,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.mkLatticeOpRule","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L186-L234"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.latticeOps\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">latticeOps</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Data/HashMap/Basic.html#Std.HashMap\">Std.HashMap</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Lattice splits of the built-in connectives, keyed by operator head. `splitLatticeOp?` looks a\nhead up here.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.latticeOps","kind":"def","line":125,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.latticeOps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L125-L128"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.builtinLatticeOps\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">builtinLatticeOps</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The built-in connective splits, whose rewrites and terminals seed every saturation.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.builtinLatticeOps","kind":"def","line":121,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.builtinLatticeOps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L121-L123"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.snd\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">snd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.snd","kind":"def","line":115,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.snd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L115-L119"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.fst\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">fst</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.fst","kind":"def","line":110,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.fst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L110-L114"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iSup\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">iSup</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Indexed supremum `iSup`/`⨆` over a proposition: distributes via `iSup_apply`, closes with\n`le_iSup_prop`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iSup","kind":"def","line":90,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iSup","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L90-L97"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iInf\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">iInf</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Indexed infimum `iInf`/`⨅`: distributes via `iInf_apply`, closes with `le_iInf`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iInf","kind":"def","line":86,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.iInf","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L86-L89"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.upperAdjoint\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">upperAdjoint</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The magic-wand residual `upperAdjoint f b`: framed for its excess state arguments, closes with\n`le_upperAdjoint`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.upperAdjoint","kind":"def","line":80,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.upperAdjoint","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L80-L85"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.exists\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">exists</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The existential `∃ h : a, b h` over a proposition `a`: closes with `le_exists_prop`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.exists","kind":"def","line":74,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.exists","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L74-L79"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.and\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">and</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The conjunction `∧` on the `Prop` lattice: closes with `le_and`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.and","kind":"def","line":71,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.and","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L71-L73"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.top\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">top</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The lattice top `⊤`: distributes via `top_apply`, closes with `le_top`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.top","kind":"def","line":68,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.top","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L68-L70"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.ofProp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">ofProp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The pure assertion `⌜·⌝`: distributes via `ofProp_apply`, closes with the `⊤`-fixed\n`CompleteLattice.top_le_ofProp`. It decomposes `pre ⊑ ⌜p⌝` only when `pre` is `⊤`: the subgoal `p`\nof any other `pre` would drop `pre`, and the terminal fails to apply.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.ofProp","kind":"def","line":61,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.ofProp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L61-L67"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.himp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">himp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Heyting implication `⇨`: distributes via `himp_apply`, closes with `le_himp_of_meet_le_left`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.himp","kind":"def","line":57,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.himp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L57-L60"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.meet\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">meet</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The lattice meet `⊓`: distributes via `meet_apply`, closes with `le_meet`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.meet","kind":"def","line":54,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.meet","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L54-L56"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.applies?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">applies?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether the split applies to this RHS. Ops without a terminal decline shapes their rewrites\ncannot reduce.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.applies?","kind":"def","line":40,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.applies?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L40-L40"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.terminal?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">terminal?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The operator's terminal `⊑`-introduction rule, or `none` when it saturates to another operator's\nterminal.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.terminal?","kind":"def","line":37,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.terminal?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L37-L37"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.rewrites\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">rewrites</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Distribution and unfolding equalities that saturate the operator applied to state arguments.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.rewrites","kind":"def","line":34,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.rewrites","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L34-L34"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.numConst\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">numConst</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The number of leading arguments held constant during rule construction: the operator's carrier\ntype and its typeclass instances. The operands and excess state arguments after them become the\nrule's schematic parameters. `2` for a connective over a `CompleteLattice` carrier; `0` for a\nmonomorphic operator.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.numConst","kind":"def","line":32,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.numConst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L32-L32"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.head\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">head</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Head constant of the operator this split decomposes. Keys the `latticeOps` table.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.head","kind":"def","line":27,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp.head","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.