span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"How to decompose a lattice operator `head … s⃗` on the RHS of an entailment: the distribution and\nunfolding `rewrites` that saturate it, and the terminal `⊑`-introduction `terminals` that close the\nreduced form. `head` keys the split in the `latticeOps` table.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp","kind":"structure","line":22,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/LatticeOp.lean#L22-L40"}}],"imports":["Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrame","Lean.Meta.AbstractMVars","Lean.Meta.AppBuilder","Lean.Meta.Sym.Apply","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Rewrite","Std.Internal.Order.FrameClosure","Std.Internal.Order.Heyting"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.LatticeOp"}